    "source": "Same quantities on both sides: the result's volume where the test measures it, and Modified / Generated / IsDeleted for every face of the first argument in TopExp::MapShapes order (deleted is IsDeleted, printed 0/1 by the probe). Bridge values are what the test observed, read from a temporary print of r.history.record(of:) for each face and of the result volume (run once and reverted, not committed; volumes at %.17g). Kernel values are from Scripts/repro/766-modeling-boolean-full-history/transcript-evidence-fix.txt, made by probe-evidence-fix.mm, which repeats the bridge's builder (BRepAlgoAPI_Fuse of two disjoint 10 mm boxes). The test asserts volume within 1e-6 of 2000 and, for each of the six faces, not deleted, 0 modified and 0 generated (before #766 it asserted volume > 0 and, for face 0 only, modified.count <= 1); that is the measured history on both sides.",
